{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2017-biology-28","exam":"MDEET","year":2017,"subject":"biology","number":28,"points":5,"unitId":"digestion","unitLabel":"소화·흡수","topic":"트립신","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["digestion"],"stem":"그림(가)는p-nitrophenylacetate에대한키모트립신의촉매\n반응을, (나)는(가)의반응에서효소1몰당생성물p-nitrophenol의\n양을시간에따라나타낸것이다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것만을<보기>에서있는대로고른것은?\n[5점]\n<보기>\nㄱ. 아세트산이p-nitrophenol보다먼저생성된다.\nㄴ. (가)에서키모트립신과공유결합하는중간생성물이존재한다.\nㄷ. 키모트립신은페닐알라닌의카르복실쪽펩티드결합을자른다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":["fig-04"],"textItemIds":["t014"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":708,"height":94,"region":0,"bbox":[28.355,70.348,283.2,37.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-28/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":485,"height":316,"region":0,"bbox":[28.355,141.148,194.0,126.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-28/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":190,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,340.748,310.4,76.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-28/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":811,"height":3,"region":0,"bbox":[-0.045,931.948,324.4,1.2],"role":"option","overlayTextItemIds":[],"optionNumber":5,"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-28/04.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[429.645,151.652,758.256,1084.406],"width":328.611,"height":932.754,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[28.355,70.348,283.2,37.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"i